OL,3,GNEWSATension and violence rising among
OL,4,Ayoung people in south London, police
OL,5,Atell BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,F"There are parents who think next time
OL,8,Fwe come to their door, it will be to
OL,9,Ftell them their child is dead."
OL,11,FI'm told this by PC Zoe Ticehurst and
OL,12,Fher colleague, Det Con Faisal El
OL,13,FIssaoui.
OL,15,FThey are showing me around the
OL,16,Fneighbourhoods of Lambeth and Southwark
OL,17,Fin south London, where some children
OL,18,Fare highly vulnerable to the gangs who
OL,19,Foperate there.
